The  driver supports Sun Microelectronics STP2002‐STQ Fast Ether‐
net interfaces.  The driver supports the on‐board Ethernet inter‐
faces of many Sun workstation and server models.  Cards supported
by the driver include: Sun PCI SunSwift Adapter Sun SBus SunSwift
Adapter and Sun PCI Sun100BaseT Adapter 2.0 Sun SBus  Sun100BaseT
2.0 Sun PCI Quad FastEthernet Controller Sun SBus Quad FastEther‐
net  Controller The STP2002 family supports hardware checksumming
to assist in computing IPv4 TCP/UDP checksums.  The  driver  sup‐
ports  this  feature  of the chip.  See for information on how to
enable this feature.  The driver first appeared in The driver was
written by Connecting a MII transceiver on those cards that  sup‐
port  it  will cause the RJ45 connector to be detected as PHY in‐
stance 1, instead of the default instance 0.
